test.yaml:12:16: this step checks out code from the run that triggered this workflow (github.event.workflow_run.head_sha) in a "workflow_run" workflow and "cargo" runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data [untrusted-checkout]
